abstract: >-
  A research database cataloguing 138 fiction films on suffragette and
  women's suffrage themes released in Britain between 1906 and 1918,
  compiled from systematic archival research in the Kinematograph Weekly
  and The Bioscope, the two principal British film trade papers of the
  period. Entries record contemporary titles, production companies,
  countries, genres, footage, release references, primary-source synopses
  and verification status. This work was supported by JSPS KAKENHI Grant
  Number 25K03664.
